Not every path in this repository is under the MIT licence above. The path
map in tools/licences.json, read top to bottom with the first match winning,
names the licence of each path. Emitter templates are MIT-0 (LICENSES/), and
the hack.build name and logo files are outside every open grant
(TRADEMARKS.md). A design or reference folder, its legacy/ archive
included, takes the licence its chase.ts declares: CC-BY-SA-4.0 for
printable designs and CERN-OHL-W-2.0 for boards; a folder without a
chase.ts carries no grant. knowledge/ (the failure corpus) is CC-BY-4.0.
docs/, the root README.md and package READMEs are CC-BY-4.0, and code
samples inside them are also MIT. Licence texts are under LICENSES/
(decisions D-185, D-042 and D-170).
